	(text "2-up panel: board A = IC1 + J1 (VCC, GND, SCL, SDA, LPN)\nboard B = IC2 + J2 (VCC_1, GND_1, SCL_1, SDA_1, LPN_1).\nBoards snap apart along the breakaway tabs; J1/J2 are\nedge pads (top + bottom copper), not BOM parts.\nEdge pad order matches riskybirdv3 ToF headers:\n1=3V3 2=GND 3=SCL 4=SDA 5=GPIO(LPn)"
